        "created_at": "2012-04-01T19:13:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Can someone explain the intended interaction between Into the Stratosphere (Tempest) and indestructible cards?  The manual entry under indestructible says “cannot be removed from play”, which I assume means that it cannot be put on top of the deck due to ItS, but I wanted to check.  Perhaps there should be an errata for this, since the term ‘indestructible’ doesn’t seem to imply ‘can’t be removed from play’?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:15.480Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 3,
