        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-01T23:21:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I interpret indestructible as in-destroy-able, which implies that the Destroy keyword cannot be applied to this card (I.e. cannot be moved from play to trash.). Anything else should be fine. IMO.</p>",
