        "created_at": "2012-04-02T03:48:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As per <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,402.0.html\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this thread</a>, the rules are intended to imply that putting them on top of the deck is removing them from play. Errata is coming soon, apparently.</p>",
