        "created_at": "2012-04-02T20:30:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We’re still waiting for an official clarification on what exactly “indestructible” means in the face of cards such as Into the Stratosphere, right?  I want to add the Smoke Bombs clarification to my PDF but figure I’ll wait for the official answer here so I can add them both at the same time.</p>",
