        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-02T20:34:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like the idea of having an errata on Spite’s flip side stating that drug cards cannot be removed from play in any manner.  This prevents Spite from “permanently” loosing drugs, as well allows indestructable cards to be otherwise removed from play so long as they don’t end up in the trash.</p>",
